# The emitted-set gate (scripts/emitted-gate.mjs) compiles these programs and
# compares the C++ with baselines tracked once for every host. A program's text
# is part of what it compiles to -- Function.prototype.toString hands back a
# function's source, line ends included -- so a CRLF checkout of them is a
# different program, and the gate read 71 runtime programs as moved on Windows.
# They are checked out with LF line ends everywhere.
test/runtime/** text=auto eol=lf
test/fixtures/** text=auto eol=lf
